# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvancePassesPendingDeferredHead
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance ignores the staleHigh while a deferred close is pending, so it passes the stale donor's routed record
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ CloseCarried => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
\* MUTATION: a pending deferred close adds no bound.
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- END
